@booking = http://localhost:7001
@booking2 = http://localhost:7011

### Live seat map (SSE). REST clients show it until you cancel; curl: curl -N <url>
GET {{booking}}/shows/SHOW-3/events
Accept: text/event-stream

### The same stream from the second instance
GET {{booking2}}/shows/SHOW-3/events
Accept: text/event-stream

### Now hold a seat on instance 1 and watch both streams get a "seats" event
POST {{booking}}/shows/SHOW-3/holds
Content-Type: application/json
X-User: alice

{ "seats": ["C4"] }

### Listener stats: LISTEN state, notifications received, reconnects, open maps per show
GET {{booking}}/admin/live

### Lab: drop the LISTEN connection; it reconnects and resyncs every open map
POST {{booking}}/admin/live/drop-connection
